B"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "376042327389414", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982666_376042330722747_8038521063931619198_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IDNWpbw7QwMQ7kNvwF6GGla&_nc_oc=AdrepzHDQCHwOreHBMG_cEjaibU4tHLCaw9IX0E88RCJ2cBoJtkXtP66_zaCe8v6Io4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3PtOVI9VSmfMhL7_25bJjySrmt4NXn9NaAfyXANOHULQ&oe=69F21939"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "254247056593741", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003245_254247059927074_3962932320837092188_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DSXbcTUqMnIQ7kNvwHK7ZNA&_nc_oc=Adol_C-5plWIMHXgYlIKRP3ckm6REMdtuNoIoo-YdkcI818hvsi94kN1ZIwX1HeSixU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1PbqIdb1UzRiXLtGcIcMlUMZScDH1r55RuYxYbR7MnAg&oe=69F1FF4E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplateLandscape.png", "id": "2028093047581095", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001732_2028093050914428_4516307181800575249_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WIZnsFBqkAgQ7kNvwEhsvHm&_nc_oc=AdoP55f3q9qZOCbNOCCb4f5wZDHYCiVwd5qzyBkEUFRxzhlNAB4XB1WFVlf1Tk8LK-o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af28JcJ81BwcNNjbdcY6ahdl9ui1zUQtLxoCMY7GQVbuFg&oe=69F21516"}, "display_name": "LoveSweet", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Introduction\uff1a\nThe goal is to create a dreamland that allows players to enter the game characters, selectively implant emotional seeds, and then harvest the energy of the dream, and finally turn the dream into reality, allowing the player to experience the game, mentally and in the game A VR game where the player characters grow together\u3002\n\nBackground\uff1a\nThe background of the game is set in the virtual dream created by the player wearing the VR headset\n\nDescription\uff1a\nIn this dream world, there are many trees of hope that have been cut down and destroyed, which is the dream that the owner of this dream has once had.\n\nIn this dream world, a new seed of hope appears, players need to plant this seed to help and protect its growth.\n\nIn the game, you can explore the dreams of other game characters.\n\nCan drive the spacecraft to sail in the subconscious mind, collect, fight, and implant hope.\n\nYou can interact with the environment and residents in your dreams.\nComplete variou\uff1b\n\n", "short_description": "The goal is to create a dreamland that allows players to enter the game characters, selectively implant emotional seeds, and then harvest the energy of the dream, and finally turn the dream into reality, allowing the player to experience the game, mentally and in the game A VR game where the player characters grow together\u3002"}]}, "developer_name": "TangJunlong", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.jkou.net/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TangJunlong", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.jkou.net/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ADVENTURE", "ART_CREATIVITY", "CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "665760168177691"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PENDING", "id": "1670320830983029"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1661750288044969"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2970670659848459"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1343227136319337"}]}, "